// The sprites of the Kenney skin, cut out of UI Pack by Kenney (kenney.nl/assets/ui-pack, CC0) by
// Art/make_ui_packs.py, which is where to change anything in here, this file is written by it. The pack is a folder
// of PNGs per colour, the same pieces in each, and those colours are the themes here, a layer of art.aseprite each.
// It is drawn with every pixel twice the size it need be, so it is kept at half of what the pack has and the skin
// draws it at two, and a button is only its two ends with a sliver between, the nine-slice makes the rest.
//
// The names are the ones the components and the layouts ask for, which are Dead Revolver's, so a layout written
// for that skin comes up in this one. Where a face isn't the colour the skin writes on (the solid buttons are
// written on in white, everything else in slate) the sprite says so itself with a text_color.

